          "blocks": {
            "rich_text_AX983L": {
              "type": "rich-text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>For the Daffodil Collection, we added a thoughtful detail: <strong>a daffodil motif</strong>, the flower that symbolizes <strong>hope and new beginnings</strong>.</p><p>Why a daffodil? These bright yellow blooms are the first to blossom at the start of spring, welcoming a new chapter and celebrating life. The vivid yellow also adds a pop of color to your outfit,  an uplifting reminder that even in dark times, light and beauty can bloom.</p>",
                "content_width": "sm"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "rich_text_AX983L"
          ]
