        "dynamic_grid_item_amf8bf": {
          "type": "_dynamic-grid-item",
          "settings": {
            "visibility": "both",
            "text_alignment": "left",
            "desktop_row_start": 29,
            "desktop_column_start": 10,
            "desktop_column_end": 16,
            "desktop_horizontal_adjustment": 0,
            "desktop_vertical_adjustment": 0,
            "mobile_row_start": 41,
            "mobile_column_start": 1,
            "mobile_column_end": 8,
            "mobile_horizontal_adjustment": 0,
            "mobile_vertical_adjustment": 4,
            "parallax_speed": 0,
            "parallax_direction": "vertical"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "rich_text_kM6XCy": {
              "type": "rich-text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>In October, we had the honor of sponsoring the <strong>Run for the Cure</strong>, a powerful event that brought together survivors, fighters, families, and supporters. For us, it was more than just a sponsorship, it was a chance to <strong>meet the community</strong> we stand behind. We handed out <strong>bandanas and collar extenders</strong> to those currently facing breast cancer and to those who have overcome it and now uplift others with their strength and wisdom.</p>",
                "content_width": "sm"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "rich_text_kM6XCy"
          ]
        },
        "dynamic_grid_item_KtDypn": {
          "type": "_dynamic-grid-item",
          "settings": {
            "visibility": "both",
            "text_alignment": "left",
            "desktop_row_start": 32,
            "desktop_column_start": 10,
            "desktop_column_end": 16,
            "desktop_horizontal_adjustment": 0,
            "desktop_vertical_adjustment": 3.5,
            "mobile_row_start": 53,
            "mobile_column_start": 1,
            "mobile_column_end": 8,
            "mobile_horizontal_adjustment": 0,
            "mobile_vertical_adjustment": 4,
            "parallax_speed": 0,
            "parallax_direction": "vertical"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "rich_text_kjN4GL": {
              "type": "rich-text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>To keep runners energized, we prepared sandwiches and drinks, making sure everyone felt supported both emotionally and physically. <strong>One moment stood out to us: </strong>a brave woman currently battling cancer visited our booth. She handed us a small bag of handmade woven fabric gifts she had prepared for other patients. She shared that her doctor had told her she was nearing the end of her life, and she simply wanted to spend her remaining time spreading kindness and supporting others still fighting. Her courage touched our hearts.</p>",
                "content_width": "sm"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "rich_text_kjN4GL"
          ]
        },
