          "blocks": {
            "rich_text_Wzf9HK": {
              "type": "rich-text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>When people are wearing our bandanas, we  see happiness and joy, and that’s what drives us. Even if we bring someone a second of happiness, it makes all our work worth it.</p>",
